# ── never publish ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# tests/ holds real project files from real jobs — a named client's whole
# stamped plan set among them — and harnesses that point at the estimator's
# own machine and project library. None of it belongs on a public repo.
tests/

# docs/spec/ is the desktop program specified back out of its source: the
# file format, the measurement schema, the scale maths, the tool behaviour.
# docs/PORTAL-EMBED.md describes internal company infrastructure.
docs/

# a local convenience that runs the dev server in tests/
start.bat

# ── ordinary noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
node_modules/
*.tgz
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.takeoff
*.pdfcache

# the internal build notes stay local
README.dev.md
